Third-party components
----------------------
Gextto links third-party Go modules. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES lists every one of
them with its copyright notice and licence text. It ships in every package
and is shown on the Licence page of the web interface.

Provenance: gx-core (internal/gxcore) and the DHT (internal/dht) were
historically developed from permissively licensed bases and have since been
rewritten file by file in this tree (see docs/evoluzione.md, section 7);
only protocol-mandated formats (BEP wire layouts, API shapes) coincide. The
full history is in git.
